## Main schema on biological pathways in Wikidata. It imports the schema for Reactome and Wikidata, 
## which imports, in turn, the native RDF schema for Wikipathways E86

IMPORT <https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Special:EntitySchemaText/E39>
IMPORT <https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Special:EntitySchemaText/E41>

# SPARQL: SELECT * WHERE {{?pathway wdt:P2410 ?id } UNION {?pathway wdt:P2410 ?id }}

<#biological_pathway> [
   <#wikidata-reactome-pathway> # Reactome
   <#wikidata-wp-pathway> # Wikipathways
]